OL,3,GNEWSAI've woken from endometriosis
OL,4,Aoperations to find the surgery hasn't
OL,5,Abeen done
OL,6,
OL,7,FKelly O'Shea says she has woken from
OL,8,Fmore than one operation to be told
OL,9,Fadequate resources were not available
OL,10,Fto do the procedure she needed.
OL,12,FThe 32-year-old, who lives with chronic
OL,13,Fpain, felt there was no alternative but
OL,14,Fto pay #20,000 for the endometriosis
OL,15,Ftreatment she needed, out of
OL,16,Ffrustration and desperation.
OL,18,FIt comes as gynaecologists warn
OL,19,Fspecialist centres in Wales dealing
OL,20,Fwith complex cases of endometriosis are
OL,21,Fin jeopardy and a national service must
OL,22,Fbe commissioned.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
