OL,3,GNEWSAI've woken from endometriosis
OL,4,Aoperations to find the surgery hasn't
OL,5,Abeen done
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe deputy minister for women's health
OL,8,Fin Wales said the current set up was
OL,9,F"not sustainable" and is discussing
OL,10,Foptions for a regional or national
OL,11,Fservice to be established.
